          Place:  Greater Faydark at the ruins near the newbie lift.<br>
          <br>
          Event:  Hopefully it will be a time when people can lend a helping hand to those actually in need.  The idea is to help outfit adventurers for their long journeys ahead.  The goal in this event is to help with patchwork, silk armor, items that are usually destroyed while adventuring but would be a great gift to someone who could actually use (fine steel weapons).  Hopefully there will be some guilds that wish to host small events for entertainment.<br>
          <br>
          Needed:  Ruined pelts:  wolf pelts for small sized, cat pelts for medium and bear pelts for large.   The majority of the people will be small sized and most can use medium but please try to bring some bear pelts to accomidate the larger races that do stay in the area.  Fine Steel weapons, not everyone cashes in fine steel or decides to sell it, some leave it to rot in the area that they are in.  If you could possibly save a few pieces instead of discarding it would be a great help.  Also, if you wish to share a trade with those in Greater Faydark, please make sure that your supplies can be bought in the surrounding cities.<br>
          <br>
          Goal:  The goal of this event is to bring those that care about the people closer together.  Messages have been sent to a few guilds and I am sorry for those that have been overlooked.  The ideal that people do not care is false.  Many do, it is very hard to gather those together and realize that many share the same thoughts.<br>
          <br>
          Calidorn Realmweaver<br>

